        <mxCell id="0oY0yhGFXMviBRu67rsU-49" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;ALV&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ABAP List Viewer (ALV) grid displays the material data based on the selection parameters. It maps material master details (MARA) alongside localized material descriptions (MAKT) into a clean, interactive tabular report.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
